WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.000
SCP-682 Vs SCP-662.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.160
Can the world’s greatest butler transfer
his skills into being the world’s best monster

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.520
slayer, and finally bring an end to SCP-682?

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.440
When asked to kill the beast, he apologized
profusely and stated that he couldn’t do

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:15.760
it.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.920
He could perhaps distract 682 by sacrificing
himself to it, at least.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.480
As the Foundation persisted&nbsp;
with their questioning,&nbsp;

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.360
Mr. Deeds made an alternate suggestion: Perhaps

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.840
if his body was laced with a powerful toxin
or booby-trapped with explosives, then fed

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.960
to SCP-682, he could do more damage.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.680
Mr. Deeds was dismissed shortly thereafter.

